@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Home Page";
}

<main>
    <section class="row" aria-labelledby="EcoconnectTitle">
        <h1 id="title">ECOCONNECT</h1>
        <p class="lead"> EcoConnect is a community‑focused environmental organisation dedicated to promoting sustainable living and positive environmental action. We bring people together to learn, share ideas, and take part in activities that help protect and improve our local environment.</p>
        <p><a href="https://www.wwf.org.uk" class="btn btn-primary btn-md">Learn more &raquo;</a></p>
    </section>

    <div class="row">
        <section class="col-md-4" aria-labelledby="whatwedoTitle">
            <h2 id="whatWeDoTitle">What We Do</h2>
            <p>
                At EcoConnect, we organise and promote a range of sustainability‑focused initiatives, including:

                Community clean‑up events to improve local spaces
                Sustainability workshops to share practical skills and knowledge
                Environmental talks led by passionate speakers
                Eco‑markets supporting ethical and local businesses

                Our events are designed to be inclusive, engaging, and impactful—helping individuals make a real difference in their communities.
            </p>
            <p><a class="btn btn-outline-dark" href="https://foe.scot">Learn more &raquo;</a></p>
        </section>
        <section class="col-md-4" aria-labelledby="getinvolvedTitle">
            <h2 id="getInvolvedTitle">Get Involved</h2>
            <p>
                NuGet is a free Visual Studio extension that makes it easy to add, remove, and update libraries and tools in Visual Studio projectsOur platform is more than just a website—it’s a space to connect and engage:

                Stay up to date with the latest events and announcements
                Read and share sustainability news
                Take part in community discussions
                Comment on posts and exchange ideas with other members

                By registering an account, you can actively participate, share feedback, and become part of a growing environmental network.p>
<p><a class="btn btn-outline-dark" href="https://www.greenpeace.org.uk/">Learn more &raquo;</a></p>
        </section>
        <section class="col-md-4" aria-labelledby="joinTitle">
            <h2 id="joinTitle">Join the Community</h2>
            <p>
                Whether you’re passionate about environmental action or just starting your sustainability journey, EcoConnect welcomes you.
                Register today, get involved, and help us work towards a greener, healthier future—together.
            </p>
            <p><a class="btn btn-outline-dark" href="https://earthwatch.org/">Learn more &raquo;</a></p>
        </section>
    </div>
</main>